    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt in conjunction with Dick Barry and Son, offer for sale this substantial detached bungalow perched on an elevated site enjoying uninterrupted views over the surrounding countryside. This home offers excellent accommodation for family living having a generous kitchen / breakfast room with sitting room and sun room / living room both having stoves providing for comfort in the winter months. This home offers four bedrooms two of which have ensuite facilities off. Externally the property is well presented having a large detached garage (57sq.m) with a high bay roller vehicular shutter door perfect for a number of uses (subject to planning). If you are looking for a spacious, comfortable home positioned in a tranquil rural setting, this could be for you!\n\nViewing is strictly by Prior Appointment with Sole Selling Agents REA Spratt 058-42211. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\n4.15m x 2.20m Timber floor, both storage press and spacious hot press off.\n\nSitting Room\n4.67m x 4.00m\nMeasurement excludes bay window which provides for impressive views over the distant countryside. Timber floor, stove incorporating back boiler connected to central heating.\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Area\n7.30m x 3.30m Tiled floor, generous selection of floor and eye level fitted units incorporating Range Master gas fired range. Both sunroom and utility room off.\n\nSun Room\n5.40m x 3.50m Located off breakfast area, timber floor, wood burning stove with Energy Efficient exposed flue to vaulted ceiling. Double french doors leading out onto south facing garden. This room benefits from the impressive views over the surrounding valley.\n\nUtility Room\n3.30m x 3.20m Tiled floor, fitted units, plumbed for washing machine, door to rear extensive patio area.\n\nBedroom 1\n3.20m x 2.80m\nMeasurement excludes built in wardrobes. Timber floor\n\nBedroom 2\n3.20m x 2.90m\nMeasurement excludes built in wardrobes. Timber floor\n\nBedroom 3\n3.40m x 2.90m Timber floor, plumbed ensuite facility off\ncurrently used as a walk in dressing room 2.9m 1.5m\n\nBedroom 4\n4.20m x 3.20m\nMeasurement excludes wall to wall built in slide robes. Timber floor, ensuite off.\n\nEn-suite\n3.30m x 1.50m Tiled floor and shower surround. Mechanical extractor.\n\nBathroom\n3.25m x 2.60m Walls and floor fully tiled. Heated towel rail, full bathroom suite to include corner jacuzzi bath, independent shower stall with Mira Elite Electric Shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Picturesque elevate site enjoying impressive views.\nGenerous garage (57sq.m).\nSheltered south west facing patio area.\nSubstantial floored attic space.\nDual central heating.\nConvenient location to a number of surrounding urban centres.\nAll floor coverings, all window furnishings, all light fittings and all integrated appliances \n Private water supply\nSeptic tank on site\nBoth oil fired and solid fuel central heating via stove"
      },
      {
